CEPB is a standalone adaptation of an earlier character-AI evaluation design.
Private character systems, real dialogue, user ratings, models, media assets,
research papers, and third-party questionnaires are not bundled or relicensed.
References are links and paraphrased descriptions, not copied test instruments.
No affiliation with or endorsement by the cited authors is claimed.

The toolkit performs offline validation and arithmetic on submitted ratings.
It does not establish consciousness, validate scientific measurement, verify
an evaluator's identity, or issue independent certification.

